{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d99970a1d20effd65209d20c2938e419e656181c1db936307b27dfb80e6cc3bf", "ja": "（海外での撮影が終わり、無事帰国した。\n長旅だったけど、このみさんは大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（海外的拍摄结束了，也平安回到了日本。虽然是段漫长的旅程，不过……小此木小姐没事吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "ac1413722f9e1ad309c4ad134577be461d504ce765861f8e394aec1fce8e2cc5", "ja": "ふぅ、やっと空港に着いたわね。\nずっと寝てたから、首がちょっと……いたたっ。", "zh": "呼，终于到机场了。\n一直在睡觉，脖子有点……疼疼疼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7b85e5338bbd8b2ba44aa6be3a558d9cada68083843efac7a376fe3d0c47a364", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですか？　今日はゆっくり休んでください。\n明日も仕事がありますからね。", "zh": "没、没事吧？今天请好好休息。\n明天还有工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "92218062206fa237f15d29e24cb639ba4562896497d774b536c0eecd9808e8d6", "ja": "そうね。心配してくれてありがとう。\nあとで、ちゃんとマッサージしておくわ。", "zh": "是啊。谢谢你这么担心我。\n之后我会好好给你按摩的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "e73c791de278ca305a1655ed13aaf5e3e64575969722d60e3aa2b018b9f4fc07", "ja": "それにしても、素敵だったわね。運河に囲まれた水の都\n……ロマンチックで美しい街並み！　……はあ～。", "zh": "不过话说回来，真是美极了呢。被运河环绕的水之都……浪漫又美丽的街景！……唉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d2a2601e640f795563db9dce2799db1fc6b097a1c7c37467cae2787914f72028", "ja": "そうですね。今回はスケジュールの都合で、\n観光する時間がとれなくて、すみません。", "zh": "是啊。这次因为行程安排，没能抽出时间观光，真是抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "58b685750757450909681a5d6cd6edded24ae9604d805549c07799ba354b54b3", "ja": "いいのいいの、気にしないで！\n撮影で少しは街を見て回れたし。それだけで充分よ。", "zh": "没事没事，别放在心上！\n拍摄的时候也稍微逛了逛街，这样就已经足够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "a2c621587050c3b52f4fb9bd2856e2507f5e49b19fcd8bea08f30bc964419c10", "ja": "心残りがあるとすれば……船頭さんの衣装を\n着たことだし、ゴンドラを漕いでみたかったかも。", "zh": "如果说还有什么遗憾的话……既然都穿了\n船夫的服装，可能还是会想试着划一下贡多拉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c94bf7ceaa2163686abe07d439fc16cb2958d3c3e694b4b5f75a37e2e3d31db4", "ja": "撮影も、川沿いや街並みが中心でしたからね。\nこのみさんの船頭姿、様になったかもしれないですね。", "zh": "这次拍摄也主要是在河边和街景取景呢。木实穿船夫装的样子，说不定还真挺像那么回事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2bf068ac926e029dc901fca4f08a9fa73e2afcdbaa2d608091363262cd9752e5", "ja": "あ、現地のガイドさんが言ってましたけど。\n船頭になるには、何年も修行が必要らしいですよ。", "zh": "啊，对了，听当地的导游说，成为船夫似乎需要修行好多年呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "b2969d0289adad0810deb308eafb826aa8a672406937f2a84df4f9c2e574cb1b", "ja": "そうなの？　今から修行をはじめたとしても、\nゴンドラを漕げるようになるのは、ずっと先ってこと？", "zh": "是这样吗？就算现在开始修行，也就是说，要过很久以后才能学会划贡多拉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "1b3dc26febe8413dbaea63af9a908f15426fee6ff5f5eaaf98cff69345fb3f37", "ja": "はあ……。大人になると、\n新しいことに挑戦するのも簡単じゃないわね……。", "zh": "唉……。长大以后，想挑战新事物也没那么容易了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c1882d4792a979c2137b89d8adda949fa139da2170109694dc01756d8ec8a5c6", "ja": "ははっ、そうですね。船を漕ぐのは難しいですが、\n他のことなら、このみさんにもすぐできますよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。划船确实不容易，不过其他事情的话，您肯定也能马上学会的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "5c6fe8b22b095b026677e01676db6b5cbb60391f9b583beccaa3eb9be340138e", "ja": "え？　他のこと……？", "zh": "诶？其他事情……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a5a938454ed69cce17b718f5dfa9b97ec52a8111de21baa5f208e1b4414c6b41", "ja": "はい。船頭は、ゴンドラを漕ぎながら歌を歌います。\n歌うだけなら修行はいりません。", "zh": "是的。船夫会一边划贡多拉，一边唱歌。\n只是唱歌的话，不需要修行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "ad9c8b1fe21ae16c2a132fc24e79764b2cb8e71ec7b36add604fe7898d5405cc", "ja": "なるほど～！　歌なら、私の得意分野ね♪\nゴンドラの上で歌うなんて、気持ちよさそうじゃない！", "zh": "原来如此～！唱歌的话，正是我的拿手领域呢♪\n在贡多拉上唱歌，感觉一定很舒服吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "08852d00b14b19b7ad99af523a945fb0d2d2c7086975f8beedf119dcb98b4586", "ja": "いいわね、船上ライブ！　ちゃんと言葉も勉強して、\n本格的にやりたいわね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "挺好的呢，船上演出！我也得好好学学语言，\n认真地办一次呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1017_p", "source_sha256": "05ff856c5240fb58210c73a0cb39cdc6fed1783de9c4ed7dbc4f1b53b3a590f0", "ja": "おお、このみさん、やる気ですね……。", "zh": "哦，这不是很有干劲嘛，木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "4bfa2c934bf6240991a2c41da10bbc691a7db5bde3b5af907a15d76b0865b163", "ja": "ええ！　機会があるなら、どんどん挑戦しないと！\nあとで後悔したくないものね。うふふっ♪", "zh": "嗯！只要有机会，就得不断挑战才行！\n我可不想以后后悔呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0333_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5aabedf6da1b7d16f5fe3a302bd59386b85727c20c1cb511f7c5195ac9774983", "ja": "（このみさんの前向きな姿勢を見習わないと……。\nゴンドラの上でライブ、実現できるように頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（我也得好好学习这个美小姐积极向上的态度才行……。\n努力争取实现乘坐缆车举行演唱会吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
